"],"vndbCharacterId":"c314"},"originalCharacterName":"天神 泰三","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The big, dumb country boy. Despite his size, Tenjin is rather simple in his way of doing things. He is Yuusuke’s roommate, and holds him in high regard. Tends to go along with whatever Bacchiguu plans, and is the muscle of the group. Has a fetish for really young girls (known as a younger sister complex), so he is naturally drawn to Sanae."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c314"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"鐘ノ音学園3年生。鐘ノ音学園の現総長であり3バカの一人。鹿児島弁混じりの方言で話す。極度のロリコン。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13545","sourceWorkId":"4555","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/02/022462d8b79d5f8661412736f6f0dac83450643f48a4c159fde175fb403d1643.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/42/42f60474d48fcbd2113e6f2d6007e8fcd59a82fd5e1d5ffd294585b6b01c090f.webp","width":173,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"浜田 賢二","creatorId":"vndb:s385","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s385","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s385","name":"浜田 賢二","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:2230","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c319","characterName":"朽木 双葉","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"22002","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"99057"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13539"],"vndbCharacterId":"c319"},"originalCharacterName":"朽木 双葉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"828"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"164"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"45"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The tomboyish man-hater. Futaba is brought to Kanenone against her will, and does everything she can to cause trouble. This includes talking back to teachers and giving all males the cold shoulder. Because of her strong personality, other girls tend to see Futaba as their leader. She has no tolerance for perversion, which makes her the natural enemy of Bacchiguu, Tenjin and Ichibanboshi."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c319"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"舞台となる学園に編入してきた女性学生の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスの女子のリーダー的存在で、何かと男子と対立し、特に天神と仲が悪い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は短気な上に負けん気が強く、縛られることや枠にはまった考えを嫌う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"平安時代に「植物を操る」と云われた陰陽師の家系に生まれ、そんな格式ばった家系を“古臭い”とバカにしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"この学校にやってきたのは、陰陽師である父親に反発してのことらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小さな胸に、いささかコンプレックスを抱いている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13539","sourceWorkId":"1988","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"鐘ノ音学園の三年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女子のリーダー的存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男嫌いな面があり、特にバッチグーとは仲が悪い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、祐介と付き合いだして多少丸くなり、暴力行為に及ぶ回数は一応減ってはいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"こっそり「家庭的な女になる努力」をしているが"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まったく実を結んでいない。胸が小さいのが悩み。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ずっとケンカ別れとなっていた祐介と、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"やっと仲直り出来たのも束の間、今度は女子寮爆破事件が……!?"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13539","sourceWorkId":"4555","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"勝気で気が短い。 しばられたり、枠にハマった考えが嫌い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスの女子のリーダー的存在で、男子、特に天神とは仲が悪い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生家は平安時代より “植物を操る” といわれる陰陽師の家系。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな家系を古臭いとバカにしていて、父への反発からこの学園へやって来た。"},{"spoiler":false,"t