ways carries around, but in reality Wakaba is very simple-minded, and can pass off as gullible at times. She doesn't have the modesty that is characteristic of girls in anime and games, and does as she's told without protest. She has a strong appreciation for plants that can bloom flowers."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c320"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"舞台となる学園に編入してきた女性学生の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"双葉の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"気が強い姉とは正反対の性格で、健気で誰にでも優しく、困っている人を見ると放っておけない奉仕精神旺盛な女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に、幼い頃から世話をしている「サボテンの鉢植え」を持ち歩いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また「サボテンは人の心がわかる」が口癖。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は園芸。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13552","sourceWorkId":"1988","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"健気で誰にでもやさしい、姉とは反対の性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人の役に立つのがうれしいらしく、困っている人を見ると放っておけない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃から世話しているサボテンの鉢植えをいつも持ち歩いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「植物は人の心がわかる」 というのが口癖。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉の双葉にくっついて編入してきた。 趣味は園芸。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"22003"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/74/7419e93b84425f762a5bd2a8254d292a18147f820226b45509bb18732ef006c7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/56/56811775bf9b92800f22b2d38adbca04e4d05256df71bde5cd5e5ce1f9ac8a1c.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c321","characterName":"バッチグー","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["13544"],"vndbCharacterId":"c321"},"originalCharacterName":"バッチグー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Leader of the quartet that includes Ichibanboshi, Tenjin and Yuusuke. Though he is